# t0832-a-screen-made-to-look-alive -- Telemetry that stopped being real, beside a write
# The sequence this pack is about. Each line is one security event:
#   <listener kind> <action> <reason>
# fire: the whole sequence, which must report.
# hold: the same sequence one signal short, which must not.
fire
  modbus alert anomaly_telemetry_frozen
  modbus alert anomaly_telemetry_frozen
  modbus alert anomaly_new_write_point
hold
  modbus alert anomaly_telemetry_frozen
  modbus alert anomaly_telemetry_frozen
